   "k": "99tr3o",
   "en": "Equipment Designer"
  },
  {
   "k": "1soakz3",
   "en": "Added in the ⟦0⟧, ⟦1⟧ and ⟦2⟧, equipment designer is the interface to design equipment with different modules, allowing to change type of equipment or just add additional stats to the equipment.",
   "frags": 3
  },
  {
   "k": "1hpzefz",
   "en": "Man the Guns"
  },
  {
   "k": "11r223j",
   "en": "No Step Back"
  },
  {
   "k": "xw4s3v",
   "en": "By Blood Alone"
  },
  {
   "k": "vhepny",
   "en": "Any equipment that utilizes modules must have equipment designer set-up, if equipment designer not presented it will instead utilize upgrade system/"
  },
  {
   "k": "2hcn95",
   "en": "The game equipment designers can be found in interface/equipmentdesigner/type where type is tanks/ships/planes. ⟦0⟧",
   "frags": 1
  },
  {
   "k": "1o6pu35",
   "en": "The name of the file doesn't mater.Equipment linked differently."
  },
  {
   "k": "16wsybr",
   "en": "To connect designer to the equipment you need to name containerWindowType with one of 4 types:"
  },
  {
   "k": "fe3sri",
   "en": "\"equipment_designer_\" EQUIPMENT_TYPE \"_\" COUNTRY_TAG - used to specify equipment designer for specific tag and specific equipment"
  },
  {
   "k": "y6lnoc",
   "en": "\"equipment_designer_\" EQUIPMENT_ARCHETYPE \"_\" COUNTRY_TAG - used to specify equipment designer for specific tag and equipment archetype"
  },
  {
   "k": "1oiqng7",
   "en": "\"equipment_designer_\" EQUIPMENT_TYPE - used to specify designer for equipment"
  },
  {
   "k": "13x42lf",
   "en": "\"equipment_designer_\" EQUIPMENT_ARCHETYPE - used to specify equipment designer for equipment archetype"
  },
  {
   "k": "1x31dwr",
   "en": "Within these equipment designer windows for a specific piece of equipment, there is an inner container window named \"module_slots\". Each module slot that is possible for any equipment using this designer window should have its own container window inside here, using the same name as the module slot."
  },
  {
   "k": "1pxeom4",
   "en": "Inside a module slot container window, further container windows should be listed, corresponding to the modules that can be installed in that module slot.Within them, you can include the iconType elements or any other elements appropriate for displaying the associated module on the equipment for that slot"
  },
  {
   "k": "95ovpp",
   "en": "Like previously mentioned new system allows for creating a special types of equipment (e.g. Anti-tank tank or Anti-Air tank), in order to do this you need a module that allows this type, this type should be present in script_enums and must have at least one battalion using it."
  },
  {
   "k": "17r95id",
   "en": "To create equipment variant you need to use this code:"
  },
  {
   "k": "snteo4",
   "en": "<equipment_archetype>_my_variant = {"
  },
  {
   "k": "1yxe4jl",
   "en": "archetype = <equipment_archetype>"
  },
  {
   "k": "71e5dy",
   "en": "type = { innitial_type anti_air }"
  },
  {
   "k": "1hxovje",
   "en": "for_each = {"
  },
  {
   "k": "7uaqzz",
   "en": "variant_name = { find_and_replace = { \"chassis\" \"equipment\" } } # optional, set variant_name by taking what would be used as the localization key (the name of the type) and run a find-and-replace on it. Example: light_tank_aa_chassis_1 gets variant_name light_tank_aa_equipment_1."
  },
  {
   "k": "143xq5n",
   "en": "hardness = { set = 0.5 } # additional stats new type of equipment would get"
  },
  {
   "k": "1pr7m1c",
   "en": "All new variants must be present in script_enums, so if you duplicate equipment archetype with 5 variants of equipment you must specified all in scripted_enums (e.g. <equipment_archetype>_my_variant, <equipment_archetype>_my_variant_0, <equipment_archetype>_my_variant_1...)"
  },
  {
